      "locator": "2KI 2:6",
      "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
      "text": "Elijah said to him, “Please wait here, for the LORD has sent me to the Jordan.” He said, “As the LORD lives, and as your soul lives, I will not leave you.” Then they both went on.",
      "textSHA256": "a4289454c925bdca38520dc23bf5943e2c65387b6988432017dc6122a2eeed85"
    },
    {
      "sourceID": "webp-2ki-2-7",
      "sourceURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/2KI02.htm#V7",
      "retrievedAtUTC": "2026-10-16T02:40:00Z",
      "locator": "2KI 2:7",
      "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
      "text": "Fifty men of the sons of the prophets went and stood opposite them at a distance; and they both stood by the Jordan.",
      "textSHA256": "cabffeca0516443bc3bc8988cdb3b71a792472aa6dbfe2ddb8c7f21a03ab56c0"
    },
    {
      "sourceID": "webp-2ki-2-13",
      "sourceURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/2KI02.htm#V13",
      "retrievedAtUTC": "2026-10-16T02:40:00Z",
      "locator": "2KI 2:13",
      "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
      "text": "He also took up Elijah’s mantle that fell from him, and went back and stood by the bank of the Jordan.",
      "textSHA256": "3c9e608a43ed10f0067a40b8b55e3f9b9222112f307c5fe98f2516ee457534e7"
    },
    {
      "sourceID": "webp-2ki-5-10",
      "sourceURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/2KI05.htm#V10",
      "retrievedAtUTC": "2026-10-16T02:40:00Z",
      "locator": "2KI 5:10",
      "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
      "text": "Elisha sent a messenger to him, saying, “Go and wash in the Jordan seven times, and your flesh shall come again to you, and you shall be clean.”",
      "textSHA256": "dcdac6e67bc20684a20c516f57a718143d51676872e58f5a012c375f61fcdb5b"
    },
    {
      "sourceID": "webp-2ki-5-14",
      "sourceURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/2KI05.htm#V14",
      "retrievedAtUTC": "2026-10-16T02:40:00Z",
      "locator": "2KI 5:14",
      "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
      "text": "Then went he down and dipped himself seven times in the Jordan, according to the saying of the man of God; and his flesh was restored like the flesh of a little child, and he was clean.",
      "textSHA256": "9d7d5211e766fe8d5054293825104647a90aded6fdc09e3d631c52f2b79d1d8c"
    },
    {
      "sourceID": "webp-2ki-6-2",
      "sourceURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/2KI06.htm#V2",
      "retrievedAtUTC": "2026-10-16T02:40:00Z",
      "locator": "2KI 6:2",
      "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
      "text": "Please let us go to the Jordan, and each man take a beam from there, and let’s make us a place there, where we may live.” He answered, “Go!”",
      "textSHA256": "8a2461b5e65125acac04f51abd105bfd9913d98d86d008fe876edc621b49c245"
    },
    {
      "sourceID": "webp-2ki-6-4",
      "sourceURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/2KI06.htm#V4",
      "retrievedAtUTC": "2026-10-16T02:40:00Z",
      "locator": "2KI 6:4",
      "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
      "text": "So he went with them. When they came to the Jordan, they cut down wood.",
      "textSHA256": "125580b07d72b9ee4c3af99b6aee2e7b2ab6500eb804049a6c541fef97f489d0"
    },
    {
      "sourceID": "webp-2ki-7-15",
      "sourceURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/2KI07.htm#V15",
      "retrievedAtUTC": "2026-10-16T02:40:00Z",
      "locator": "2KI 7:15",
      "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
      "text": "They went after them to the Jordan; and behold, all the path was full of garments and equipment which the Syrians had cast away in their haste. The messengers returned and told the king.",
      "textSHA256": "3bff0b50a8e79dada5d8a58cd9285d13d0a8cdfe133a9f719798bc3be0d0fe05"
    },
    {
      "sourceID": "webp-2ki-10-33",
      "sourceURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/2KI10.htm#V33",
      "retrievedAtUTC": "2026-10-16T02:40:00Z",
      "locator": "2KI 10:33",
      "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
      "text": "from the Jordan eastward, all the land of Gilead, the Gadites, and the Reubenites, and the Manassites, from Aroer, which is by the valley of the Arnon, even Gilead and Bashan.",
      "textSHA256": "e7a24b65b88b35b6790816df774e17594562b378c724956d714b83b8662c82b1"
    }
  ],
